<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Gallery on CodeImp</title><link>https://game1991.github.io/CodeImp/en/categories/gallery/</link><description>Recent content in Gallery on CodeImp</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Fri, 20 Dec 2024 16:56:12 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://game1991.github.io/CodeImp/en/categories/gallery/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Image gallery</title><link>https://game1991.github.io/CodeImp/en/2023/image-gallery/</link><pubDate>Sat, 26 Aug 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://game1991.github.io/CodeImp/en/2023/image-gallery/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://game1991.github.io/CodeImp/2023/%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E7%94%BB%E5%BB%8A/2.jpg" alt="Featured image of post Image gallery" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hugo theme Stack supports the creation of interactive image galleries using Markdown. It&amp;rsquo;s powered by &lt;a class="link" href="https://photoswipe.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;PhotoSwipe&lt;/a&gt; and its syntax was inspired by &lt;a class="link" href="https://typlog.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;Typlog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To use this feature, the image must be in the same directory as the Markdown file, as it uses Hugo&amp;rsquo;s page bundle feature to read the dimensions of the image. &lt;strong&gt;External images are not supported.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="syntax"&gt;Syntax
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;
&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt"&gt;1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-markdown" data-lang="markdown"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;![&lt;span class="nt"&gt;Image 1&lt;/span&gt;](&lt;span class="na"&gt;1.jpg&lt;/span&gt;) ![&lt;span class="nt"&gt;Image 2&lt;/span&gt;](&lt;span class="na"&gt;2.jpg&lt;/span&gt;)
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id="result"&gt;Result
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;
&lt;div class="post-img-view"&gt;
&lt;a data-fancybox="gallery" href="1.jpg"&gt;
&lt;img src="1.jpg" alt="Image 1" /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class="post-img-view"&gt;
&lt;a data-fancybox="gallery" href="2.jpg"&gt;
&lt;img src="2.jpg" alt="Image 2" /&gt;
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Photo by &lt;a class="link" href="https://unsplash.com/@mymind" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;mymind&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class="link" href="https://unsplash.com/@lukechesser" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;Luke Chesser&lt;/a&gt; on &lt;a class="link" href="https://unsplash.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;Unsplash&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>